WEBVTT

00:07:28.496 --> 00:07:30.869
Here it is, finally to be revealed.

00:07:30.893 --> 00:07:33.587
First: accrue wealth, power and prestige,

00:07:33.611 --> 00:07:34.783
then lose it.

00:07:34.807 --> 00:07:36.791
(Laughter)

00:07:36.815 --> 00:07:40.761
Second: spend as much of your life
in prison as you possibly can.

00:07:40.785 --> 00:07:41.787
(Laughter)

00:07:41.811 --> 00:07:44.992
Third: make somebody else
really, really rich.

00:07:45.016 --> 00:07:47.599
And finally: never, ever join the Beatles.

00:07:47.623 --> 00:07:48.647
(Laughter)

00:07:48.671 --> 00:07:49.822
Yeah, right.

00:07:49.846 --> 00:07:51.932
Because when people synthesize happiness,

00:07:51.956 --> 00:07:54.150
as these gentlemen seem to have done,

00:07:54.174 --> 00:07:57.953
we all smile at them,
but we kind of roll our eyes and say,

00:07:57.977 --> 00:08:00.398
"Yeah, right, you never
really wanted the job."